{"tutorial":{"title":"电路怎样让小灯亮起来","summary":"画出电源、开关、导线与小灯，沿着路径逐段检查。使用安全低压器材，不接触家庭市电做实验。","scenes":[{"title":"灯亮需要完整通路","seconds":15,"narration":"用低压电池、小灯和导线组成简单电路。只有形成完整通路，电流才能通过小灯，让它亮起来。","points":["低压教学示意","完整通路"],"visual":{"kind":"cycle","labels":["电池","导线","小灯","返回电池"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"用低压电池、小灯和导线组成简单电路","startMs":120,"endMs":3817,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"只有形成完整通路","startMs":3817,"endMs":5665,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"电流才能通过小灯","startMs":5665,"endMs":7514,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"让它亮起来","startMs":7514,"endMs":8746,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/simple-circuit/01.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"电池提供能量","seconds":15,"narration":"电池把自身储存的能量提供给电路，小灯把电能转成光和热。电流不是被灯消耗掉的一种材料。","points":["能量发生转化"],"visual":{"kind":"flow","labels":["电池储能","电路传递","光与热"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"电池把自身储存的能量提供给电路","startMs":120,"endMs":3353,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"小灯把电能转成光和热","startMs":3353,"endMs":5576,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"电流不是被灯消耗掉的一种材料","startMs":5576,"endMs":8607,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/simple-circuit/02.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"开关改变通路","seconds":15,"narration":"开关闭合时，通路接通；开关断开时，通路中断。把开关想成控制道路是否连通的一处门。","points":["闭合：接通","断开：中断"],"visual":{"kind":"compare","labels":["开关闭合","开关断开"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"开关闭合时","startMs":120,"endMs":1367,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"通路接通","startMs":1367,"endMs":2407,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"开关断开时","startMs":2407,"endMs":3654,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"通路中断","startMs":3654,"endMs":4693,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"把开关想成控制道路是否连通的一处门","startMs":4693,"endMs":8435,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/simple-circuit/03.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"不要让电池直接短路","seconds":15,"narration":"如果用导线直接连接电池两端，可能产生很大电流，导致发热和损坏。实验应使用合适低压器材。","points":["避免直接连接两极"],"visual":{"kind":"compare","labels":["经过小灯的通路","直接连接两端"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"如果用导线直接连接电池两端","startMs":120,"endMs":3077,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"可能产生很大电流","startMs":3077,"endMs":4979,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"导致发热和损坏","startMs":4979,"endMs":6669,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"实验应使用合适低压器材","startMs":6669,"endMs":9203,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/simple-circuit/04.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"电流方向是一种约定","seconds":15,"narration":"传统电流方向按正电荷移动方向规定。分析直流电路时，外部电路按电源正极到负极来标示。","points":["使用统一方向约定"],"visual":{"kind":"flow","labels":["正极","外部电路","负极"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"传统电流方向按正电荷移动方向规定","startMs":120,"endMs":3670,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"分析直流电路时","startMs":3670,"endMs":5341,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"外部电路按电源正极到负极来标示","startMs":5341,"endMs":8682,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/simple-circuit/05.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"串联是一个接一个","seconds":15,"narration":"把两只小灯接在同一条路径上，形成串联。通路中任何一处断开，整条路径都会中断。","points":["同一条路径"],"visual":{"kind":"flow","labels":["电池","灯一","灯二"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"把两只小灯接在同一条路径上","startMs":120,"endMs":3125,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"形成串联","startMs":3125,"endMs":4198,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"通路中任何一处断开","startMs":4198,"endMs":6345,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"整条路径都会中断","startMs":6345,"endMs":8277,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/simple-circuit/06.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"并联是分成不同支路","seconds":15,"narration":"并联给每只灯提供各自的支路。某一支路断开，不一定让另一支路中断，要看它们如何连接。","points":["不同支路"],"visual":{"kind":"compare","labels":["支路一：灯一","支路二：灯二"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"并联给每只灯提供各自的支路","startMs":120,"endMs":2963,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"某一支路断开","startMs":2963,"endMs":4385,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"不一定让另一支路中断","startMs":4385,"endMs":6619,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"要看它们如何连接","startMs":6619,"endMs":8447,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/simple-circuit/07.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"电压和电流不是同一个量","seconds":15,"narration":"电压描述推动电荷移动的条件，电流描述单位时间通过的电荷量。测量与单位不同，不能混着说。","points":["电压：伏特","电流：安培"],"visual":{"kind":"compare","labels":["电压 V","电流 A"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"电压描述推动电荷移动的条件","startMs":120,"endMs":2974,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"电流描述单位时间通过的电荷量","startMs":2974,"endMs":6032,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"测量与单位不同","startMs":6032,"endMs":7663,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"不能混着说","startMs":7663,"endMs":8885,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/simple-circuit/08.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"电阻影响电流","seconds":15,"narration":"在一定条件下，电阻越大，同样电压下电流越小。欧姆定律适用于符合条件的导体，不是所有器件。","points":["先看适用条件"],"visual":{"kind":"flow","labels":["一定电压","改变电阻","电流变化"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"在一定条件下","startMs":120,"endMs":1533,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"电阻越大","startMs":1533,"endMs":2542,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"同样电压下电流越小","startMs":2542,"endMs":4561,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"欧姆定律适用于符合条件的导体","startMs":4561,"endMs":7589,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"不是所有器件","startMs":7589,"endMs":9002,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/simple-circuit/09.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"用数字做一个示意","seconds":15,"narration":"一个符合欧姆定律的电阻，两端电压六伏，电阻三欧姆。用电压除以电阻，电流是两安培。","points":["6 ÷ 3 = 2"],"visual":{"kind":"code","labels